In this role, you will be responsible for performing various tasks, including:
- Support daily account management by working closely with an Account Director and serving as a key point of coordination across clients, internal teams, creative partners, and vendors;
- Manage multiple client projects and media campaigns simultaneously, ensuring timelines, deliverables, and deadlines remain on track;
- Assign tasks, monitor progress, and coordinate execution across digital teams, creative partners, media partners, and vendors;
- Oversee campaign launches across digital and traditional media channels, including Meta, influencer, and other paid media initiatives;
- Monitor campaign pacing and execution to ensure campaigns are running according to plan, budget, and strategy;
- Review campaign assets and specifications to help ensure correct formats and sizes before launch;
- Create presentations and proposals and compile research to support client accounts and campaign initiatives;
